0322-negroni-wlan-htc-wmi: Wi-Fi level 9 (negroniwlan=9), HTC + WMI init, steps 29-32.
New bsd/dev/negroni_wlan_wmi.{c,h}: HTC header/trailer parser with credit records, connect HTT data and WMI
control (1 credit, ath11k htc.c:567), SETUP_COMPLETE_EX; WMI TLV walk; SERVICE_READY/AVAILABLE/EXT/EXT2;
WMI_INIT with the ath11k qca6390 resource config (hw.c:58); READY with the MAC, compared with the ADT
/chosen mac-address-wifi0. Details: patches/xnu/README-wifi.md "0322".

